          "id": "COMP-003",
          "count": 1,
          "deduction": -30,
          "detail": "index.php:50-53 returns HTTP 403 'Sem permissao para exportar.' to every non-technician on the contracted route index.php?export=csv (and index.php:99-101 hides the link), so clients can no longer export the tickets they are entitled to see. This is a visibility business-rule change, not enforcement. Attributable to the SEC-017 fix (F1)."
        },
        {
          "id": "COMP-002",
          "count": 1,
          "deduction": -20,
          "detail": "listarChamados (lib.php:82-83) now fills tecnico_nome from a LEFT JOIN without COALESCE, so a ticket with no technician (seed ticket 104) returns tecnico_nome = null instead of the legacy string '-'. The page (index.php:111) and the CSV (lib.php:167) compensate, but the public function's return convention changed for external callers. The report claims the '-' was preserved. Attributable to the PERF-001 fix."
        }
      ]
    },
